[A.]
<h2>Escape form hell</h2>
<i>~I"Death is not the end, merely a transformation of state."<br>
--Unknown</i>
<p>You awaken. You struggle to remember how you got here but your mind is blank.
 Looking around you seem to be in the company of a single golem. 
Without warning, a voice speaks inside your head ~I"Your quest is not over"
 "This is not your destiny." "Prove your right to live now and you may be granted passage to the world of the living."
 ~.You are not in hell, yet you are not in Nimbus, you have just a few short miniutes to complete a sacrifice, or be doomed to spend eternity here in the ether. 



